      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "智能体／平台技能（`src/skills`）",
      "prov:value": "> `editor`、`readability-editing`、`todo-review`、`symbiotic-interaction` 和 `deployment-auth` 现已（通用化后）移至下方的 **`folio-core`** 捆绑包中 — 请使用 `package_name=\"folio-core\"` 获取它们。"
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/concepts/zh/skills.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "平台技能包（`skills/tools/folio-core`、`folio-assistant-core/skills/content/folio-document-adapter`、`folio-assistant-sci/skills/content/folio-paper-adapter`）",
      "prov:value": "更大型的**平台技能包**（platform bundles），其中两个从 qou 内容仓库迁移而来（参见[迁移记录](https://github.com/litlfred/folio-assistant/issues/202)以及 issue [#27](https://github.com/litlfred/folio-assistant/issues/27)）。它们与具体内容无关，旨在同步到任何 folio 中：",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
